This reproduces the cited context fact exactly: job-level `if:` has `github`,
`needs`, `vars`, and `inputs`, not `secrets`; `jobs.<job_id>.env` does include
`secrets`. It establishes expression availability, not a GitHub-hosted runtime
conclusion for an unset variable.

