## Check 4 — source and documentation citations

Eight direct `curl` spot checks, each against
`https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/claude-code-action/v1.0.220/`,
returned HTTP 200: `action.yml`, `.github/workflows/claude-review.yml`,
`.github/workflows/claude.yml`, `examples/pr-review-comprehensive.yml`,
`examples/claude.yml`, `docs/setup.md`, `docs/security.md`, and `docs/faq.md`.
Their inspected text reproduced the cited facts: composite execution; federation
inputs; maintainer review `types: [opened]` and `pull-requests: write`;
maintainer assistant's four event/mention condition and `@main`; WIF's three
identifiers, administrator requirement, `id-token: write` requirement, and
inline-classification tradeoff; the untrusted-ref warning; and no-prompt
interactive mode. `examples/claude.yml` and pinned py are identical from `on:`
through the last `if:` clause; their following `runs-on` lines intentionally
differ (`ubuntu-latest` versus py's variable fallback).

